  "markdown_content": "## Development Announcement\\nQpiAI has announced the development of India's most powerful quantum computer, code-named \"Indus Quantum Computer.\" This breakthrough achievement represents a significant step forward in India's quantum computing capabilities.\\n\\n## Future Roadmap\\nThe company has revealed an ambitious roadmap for quantum computing development, with plans to scale up their technology significantly. Future iterations include:\\n\\n* The 64-qubit \"Kaveri\" system\\n* The 128-qubit \"Ganges\" computer\\n* The 1000-qubit \"Everest\" NISQ (Noisy Intermediate-Scale Quantum) quantum computer\\n\\n## Impact\\nThis development positions India among the select nations with advanced quantum computing capabilities, promising applications across various sectors including scientific research, cryptography, and complex computational problems.",
